#: kxmlrpcd.cpp:34
msgid ""
"The daemon is not started by default.\n"
"If you check this box, then the next time KDE starts, so will the XML RPC "
"daemon."
msgstr ""
"Ni chychwynnir yr ellyll yma gan ragosod.\n"
"Os brithir y blwch yma, wedyn y to nesaf y cychwynnir KDE, cychwynnir yr ellyll RPC XML hefyd."

#: kxmlrpcd.cpp:38
msgid ""
"By default, the daemon uses port 18300 (or higher) to listen to incoming "
"requests. You may override this here.\n"
"You may not choose a \"protected\" value (below 1024)."
msgstr ""
"Gan ragosod, defnyddia'r ellyll borth 18300 (neu uwch) i wrando ar geisiadau cyrraedd.  Gallwch anwybyddu hyn yma.\n"
"Ni chewch ddewis gwerth \"amddiffynedig\" (dan 1024)."

#: kxmlrpcd.cpp:123
msgid "<h1>XML RPC Daemon</h1> You can configure the XML RPC daemon here."
msgstr "<h1>Ellyll RPC XML</h1> Gallwch ffurfweddu yr ellyll RPC XML yma."

